�... Ena mpoumpouneto akousteke ston kokkino brakho ki epeita e ge anapedese ki arkhise na trantazetai me statherous spasmous, eno o thorubos megalone exisou stathera. O Ralph tinakhteke ston aera, xanapese, sprogmenos pano sta kladia. Dexia tou, kai molis liga metra parapera, oloklere e sustada egeire kai oi rizes ourliaxan kathos bgekan entelos exo apo to khoma. Eide kati kokkino pou gurize arga sa mulopetra. Epeita to kokkino pragma perase, ogkodes ki argokineto san elephantas, ki exaphanisteke pros te thalassa..."�	
�	Mia nukhta tou Iouniou tou 1300, enas andras brisketai dolophonemenos se mia egkataleimmene ekklesia exo apo te Phlorentia, ste base enos terastiou psephidotou.
Ten ereuna gia ten exikhniase tou musteriou analambanei o gnostos poietes Dantes Aligkieri pou molis ekhei eklegei melos tou Sumbouliou ton Proistamenon tes Koinotetas. E ereuna apodeiknuetai idiaitera duskole, kathos parempodizetai diarkos apo paraplanetikes endeixeis kai skontaphtei se anapanteta erotemata.
Poio mustiko skopeue na apokalupsei me to ergo tou o dolophonemenos kallitekhnes; Poia einai e goeteutike Antilia, e khoreutria pou kato apo to bammeno prosopo tes krubei mia panarkhaie eugenike katagoge; Ti prospathoun na petukhoun oi opadoi tou autokratora; Ti phobatai kai ti thelei na krupsei o papas; Ti odegese ste Phlorentia te suntrophia ton logion pou etoimazontai na idrusoun to kainourgio panepistemio; Ti krubetai piso apo ton Trito Ourano;
Ena sunarpastiko, klasiko muthistorema musteriou, kai tautokhrona ena goeteutiko khroniko tes Phlorentias ton teleutaion, skoteinon mesaionikon khronon, prin apo te lampse tes Anagenneses, me protagoniste enan aprosmeno Dante Aligkieri."�
�O Tzak Phitzeralnt, Maori sten katagoge, katatakhtheke sten Astunomia tou Oklant meta te musteriode exaphanise tes gunaikas tou kai tes kores tou sto Notio Nesi tes Neas Zelandias. Otan e eidese tes autoktonias tou phtanei ston palio tou philo Pol Osmporn sten Australia, ekeinos petaei amesos ste Nea Zelandia gia na anazetesei ten aletheia, pepeismenos oti o thanatos tou Tzak den etan autoktonia. Eidikos ston politismo ton Maori, o Osmporn entopizei ta teleutaia bemata tou philou tou se enan apokrupho kosmo musteriou. Parallela omos epistrephei kai sto diko tou parelthon. E Khana, pou te leei "gunaika tou" kai pou te gnorizei apo paidi, emphanizetai kai pali sto dromo tou. Kai kathos oi exaphaniseis sunekhizontai, ena pagero skeniko bias kai narkotikon ousion khtizetai. Mazi me ta gonidia, sto aima ton anthropon metapheretai kai e dipsa gia ekdikese... Outou semainei ekdikese.
To Outou einai sunarpastiko, me gregoro ruthmo. Sunekhos amphisbetei tis bebaiotetes, sokarei kai tautokhrona psukhagogei. Sto biblio kanenas kharakteras den einai asphales, e anaptuxe tes plokes den einai e anamenomene.
Kai ta duo muthistoremata tes Sagka Maori tou Karul Phere, to Khaka kai to Outou, skoteina kai gemata bia, uphainoun ten upothese tous pano sten katastase mias khoras gemates esoterikes sugkrouseis apo te makraione dusphoria ton ithagenon katoikon tes pou ekdiokhthekan apo te ge tous, sterethekan ton politismo tous kai apetukhan na aphomoiothoun sto prokathorismeno plaisio tes taxes ton leukon apoikon.
(Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"�
�Ston "Sosia", o suggrapheas kataduetai ston psukhiko kosmo tou demosiou upallelou Gkoliatkin (pou mas phernei sto mualo ton bibliko Goliath). O eroas mas thelei na "trabaei ton dromo tou", alla kai thelei na "me diapherei katholou ap' tous allous anthropous". Dikhazetai: o pragmatikos Gkoliatkin emmenei sten idiaiteroteta tou, o sosias tou upotassetai ston geniko komphormismo, ginetai idios me tous allous anthropous. O Ntostogiephski perigraphei aristotekhnika te sugkrouse ton duo staseon, ten ekphrase tous ste zoe tou eroa, ten tragike katalexe..."�
�Perigraphe:
O Manolo Regies, ouorphos aletes tes Barkelones, pernaei tis ueres tou klebontas uekhanakia kai allazontas koritsia. Ena bradu glistraei stous kepous uias uperokhes bilas ue uono skopo na kataktesei uia oraia kai plousia kopela. Ouos sto paikhnidi tes agapes pianetai sta dikhtua kauia phora o idios o psaras...
Ta Teleutaia apogeuuata ue ten Tereza, uuthistoreua-stathuos tes sugkhrones ispanikes logotekhnias kai to ergo pou kathierose diethnos ton suggraphea tou, einai e istoria enos thuellodous erota ste Barkelone tes dekaetias tou '60. Tou erota enos nearou antra, ue tsigganike katagoge kai uegalouenou stis phtokhogeitonies, e uegalutere philodoxia tou opoiou einai na apoktesei koinoniko goetro, kai uiasouorphes kai eugenikes neares gunaikas, tes Terezas, gonou oikogeneias tes upseles katalanikes koinonias tes poles. Ta prosopa autou tou uuthistoreuatos anekoun pleon dikaiouatika sten pinakotheke ton logotekhnikon eroon pou antikatoptrizoun uia oloklere epokhe kai ekphrazoun ten anthropine katastase sten pio uukhia aletheia tes.
<>
ArtouroPereth-Reberte"�	
�	Duo einai ta musteria pou stoikheionoun te zoe tes Kananta Gkolnt, kai einai apophasismene na ta dialeukanei. To proto aphora to an pragmatika einai dolophonos o diasemos mousikosunthetes pateras tes. Kai to deutero poios einai, telika, autos pou ton dolophonese. Ekeino pou den upopsiazetai einai oti o kuklos tou aimatos den ekhei kleisei kai oti kapoioi epiphulassoun kai gia ten idia ten tukhe tou patera tes. Khoris na to xerei, ekhei emplakei se enan emphulio pou mainetai epi aiones stous kolpous tes arkhaias mustikes adelphotetas ton "Khilion", pou einai oi apogonoi ton matheton tou Puthagora. Theoretika, askholountai me tis epistemes, ta mathematika, te mousike kai tis tekhnes, alla to meso gia na petukhainoun tous stokhous tous einai to egklema.
To sunarpastiko muthistorema tou Kebin Gkilphoil parasurei ton anagnoste se ena agoniodes taxidi apo to Las Begkas sto Sikago, apo ten arkhaia Ellada ste sugkhrone Amerike. Aphegoumeno mia prosektika skhediasmene sunomosia pou basizetai se theories opadon tou Puthagora, Oi Khilioi einai, pano ap' ola, e istoria ton prospatheion mias neas gunaikas na xekhorisei ten aletheia apo to psema, kathos ena kukloma iskhuron anthropon epikheirei na te khresimopoiesei pros ophelos tou."�
�Se mia perasmene epokhe, enas suggrapheas, antidikei me ton eroa tou, ton allo tou eauto, pano sta gegonota tes zoes tou, kai arneitai na apokalupsei to onoma tou. Legetai pos e trela einai aplos mia alle glossa. Milontas loipon aute te glossa, ston kosmo tes logikes, me ekhthro ton idio tou ton eauto, o Kurios me ta Khrusanthema tha katapherei na epibiosei. Parapano apo auto. Tha katapherei na zesei, oste sto telos kamia semasia den tha ekhoun pia ta pragmatika onomata."�
�E moiraia philia duo andron, me phonto te megale peripeteia tes Aristeras apo te dekaetia tou 50 eos semera.
O Gregores Mikhael epistrephei sto Boukouresti to kalokairi tou 2014, ste duse pia tou biou tou, kai aphenei tis anamneseis na ton parasuroun se ena thuellodes taxidi me apheteria to 1956.
Ekei, sto allote krataio Hotel National, anamesa stous polukairismenous toikhous, tis skies kai ta prosopika tou phantasmata, anagkazetai na erthei antimetopos me tis aletheies, ta psemata kai tis anomologetes enokhes tou.
Ti pege, aletheia, toso lathos kai eidan oloi ta neanika tous oneira na sunthlibontai apo ten exousia; Kai poies oduneres ekplexeis perimenoun auton ton 82khrono antra apo te stigme pou apophasise na skalisei to parelthon;
To Hotel National einai mia istoria-phoros times gia ekeinous pou aphesan na tous parasuroun oi anemoi tes Istorias."�
�To Ligotero apo meden einai to proto muthistorema pou exedose o Ellis otan etan akome phoitetes sto kolegio. To biblio me thema te <>tes Kaliphornias ste dekaetia tou 80 kai to triptukho sex, narkotika kai rok ent rol, einai ena khroniko tes isopedoses kai tes uperboles pou empneei to Los Antzeles kai kharakteristeke apo pollous os e prote phone mias neas genias -o,ti uperxe antistoikha gia te genia ton mpet to On the Road tou Kerouak.
To biblio gnorise protophane epitukhia, metaphrasteke se para polles glosses, guristeke tainia kai apotelese pege empneuses gia analoga egkheiremata ste logotekhnia kai ton kinematographo."�
�Einai to proto biblio tou Orkhan Pamouk. Ekdotheke to 1982, kerdise to brabeio muthistorematos Orkhan Kemal kai proanaggellei ten katopine lampre suggraphike poreia tou nompelista pia Pamouk.
To muthistorema kaluptei te zoe trion genion mias oikogeneias apo tis arkhes tou aiona, ta teleutaia khronia tes basileias tou soultanou Ampntoulkhamit, mekhri tis meres mas.
O Tzebntet mpee einai idioktetes mikrou emporikou katastematos ki enas apo tous protous Mousoulmanous emporous, pou stokhos kai philodoxia tou einai na ginei plousios kai na apoktesei mia sugkhrone oikogeneia "Dutikou" tupou kai nootropias. E istoria tou Tzebntet mpee kai ton gion tou einai, kata mia ennoia, kai e istoria tes idiotikes zoes ta khronia tes Tourkikes Demokratias.
Sto panoramiko auto muthistorema, perigraphontai ta esoterika ton spition, o kainourgios tropos zoes stis polukatoikies, oi iskhures, ekdutikismenes oikogeneies, ta kuriakatika apogeumata guro apo to radiophono, oi boltes gia psonia sta magazia sto Mpegioglou, oi agapes kai ta pathe tes anerkhomenes astikes taxes tes tourkikes koinonias.
"Otan apophasisa oti tha gino suggrapheas", leei o Orkhan Pamouk sta "Alla khromata" ("E sunenteuxe sto Paris Review"), "den exera ti ethela na grapso. Malista, ekana ki ena-duo lathos xekinemata. Ekho akome tis semeioseis mou. Epeita apo exi menes omos eikha ede to proskhedio tou bibliou pou ekdotheke telika: "Tzebntet mpee kai uioi". Einai mia oikogeneiake sagka. Opos e Forsyte saga tou Tzon Gkalsgouorthi e oi Mpountenmprok tou Tomas Man."�
�Uperkhe panta mesa tou e bathia kharakia pou aphese to perasma apo tis metemphuliakes ekeines paidopoleis -endoxous basilikous topous upotages kai kheiragogeses, stathmous kathagiasmenous monon kat' onoma: "Apostolos Paulos", "Agios Kharalampos", "Kale Panagia", "Agios Demetrios", Athena, Beroia, Thessalonike, 1949-1955.
Ekhontas apo kairo dianusei tis perissoteres apo tis anapotreptes diadromes tou, o Giannes Arkhontes phtanei monos tou ena apogeuma tou Iouniou se kapoia eremike akte tou Aigaiou. Den etan toso e anagke enos telikou apologismou, oso e epimone "anazetese tou khamenou khronou" kai ton semadion pou aphese mesa tou mia epokhe ermetika kleiste, opos ta perikleista kai perilampra idrumata, opou ezese exi apo ta prota paidika khronia tou.
Ekei, ten ora pou ena photagogemeno karabi perna anoikhta mesa ste nukhta, apo ton "tholo butho" tes mnemes tou, opou gia perissotero apo penenta khronia to eikhe apothesei, anaduetai aprosdoketa to phasma tou paidiou pou kapote uperxe, gia na pei epitelous oloklere ten palia istoria tou.
Oso krata e kophtere "nukhta tou Theriste", mprosta sto skoteiniasmeno pelagos, o orimos antras kai to xerizomeno agori emplekontai se duo paraxenous kai skhedon parallelous monologous. O sugkhronismos tes agoures mnemes me ten ustere krise dikhazei se duo opseis to prosopo tou Gianne, kanontas ten idia stigme trauma kai iase na sunuparkhoun.
To Paidi mila akatapausta, m' ole ten agnoia kai ten athooteta tes elikias tou, an kai me aprosdokete merikes phores akribeia* anasurei, mera me te mera, ta katakhoniasmena khronia tou se keina ta paidika stratopeda* diaskhizei akome mia phora me odune ten anudre eremo, anazetontas te khamene pege tes alethines agapes. Eno oi araies <>tou orimou antra moiazei na apeuthunontai mono ston idio, aphou auto pou anazeta, piso apo tis emmones, tis apotheseis kai tis phobies tou, den einai para to diko tou pragmatiko prosopo."␀␀�@"	��Q�@"	333333@"	R���Q@"	ffffff@"	q=
